{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46847","headline":"乱後经西山寺 · 齐己","name":"乱後经西山寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"松烧寺破是刀兵，谷变陵迁事可惊。\n云里乍逢新住主，石边重认旧题名。\n闲临菡萏荒池坐，乱踏鸳鸯破瓦行。\n欲伴高僧重结社，此身无计舍前程。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46847.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46847","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}